        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion BV-A2, Proteus Lever with Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith its sleek style and modern look, the Proteus Lever with Contemporary Rose is a great choice for contemporary homes. Choose from brushed nickel, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. The Proteus Leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Proteus Leverset with Round Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the BV Proteus Lever with A2 Contemporary Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Proteus Lever with Contemporary Rose, Fusion BV-A2",
                "description": "Fusion BV-A2, Proteus Lever with Contemporary Rose - With its sleek style and modern look, the Proteus Lever with Contemporary Rose is a great choice for contemporary homes. Choose from brushed nickel, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. The Proteus Leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.  It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.",
